msgid "AWS CLI configured with permissions to create IAM resources"
msgstr "IAM 리소스를 생성할 권한으로 구성된 AWS CLI"

#: ../../source/agents/docs/aws_bedrock_setup.md:12
msgid "Access to the Mattermost System Console as a system administrator"
msgstr "시스템 관리자로서 OKR.BEST 관리자 도구에 대한 접근 권한"

#: ../../source/agents/docs/aws_bedrock_setup.md:14
msgid "Enabling model access"
msgstr "모델 접근 활성화"

#: ../../source/agents/docs/aws_bedrock_setup.md:16
msgid ""
"Before creating IAM resources, ensure the models you want to use are "
"enabled in your AWS account."
msgstr ""
"IAM 리소스를 생성하기 전에, 사용하려는 모델이 AWS 계정에서 활성화되어 있는지 "
