#: ../../source/agents/docs/aws_bedrock_setup.md:60
msgid ""
"For Amazon (Nova, Titan), Meta (Llama), Mistral, and other non-Anthropic "
"models:"
msgstr ""
"Amazon(Nova, Titan), Meta(Llama), Mistral 및 기타 비 Anthropic 모델의 경우:"

