#: ../../source/agents/docs/aws_bedrock_setup.md:236
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "문제 해결"

#: ../../source/agents/docs/aws_bedrock_setup.md
msgid "Issue"
msgstr "문제"

#: ../../source/agents/docs/aws_bedrock_setup.md
msgid "Resolution"
msgstr "해결"

#: ../../source/agents/docs/aws_bedrock_setup.md
msgid ""
"`AccessDeniedException: not authorized to perform "
"bedrock:InvokeModelWithResponseStream`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/aws_bedrock_setup.md
msgid ""
"Ensure the IAM policy includes `bedrock:InvokeModel` and "
"`bedrock:InvokeModelWithResponseStream`. Note that `bedrock:Converse` is "
"not a valid IAM action. Also ensure the `inference-profile/*` ARN is "
"included if using Anthropic Claude models."
msgstr ""
"IAM 정책에 `bedrock:InvokeModel`과 `bedrock:InvokeModelWithResponseStream`이 "
"포함되어 있는지 확인하세요. `bedrock:Converse`는 유효한 IAM 작업이 아닙니다. 또한 "
"Anthropic Claude 모델을 사용하는 경우 `inference-profile/*` ARN이 포함되어 있는지 "
"확인하세요."

#: ../../source/agents/docs/aws_bedrock_setup.md
msgid ""
"`ValidationException: Invocation of model ID ... with on-demand "
"throughput isn't supported`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/aws_bedrock_setup.md
msgid ""
"You are using a raw model ID for a model that requires a Cross-Region "
"Inference Profile. Use the inference profile ID instead (e.g., "
"`us.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6` instead of `anthropic.claude-"
"sonnet-4-6`)."
msgstr ""
"교차 리전 추론 프로필이 필요한 모델에 원시 모델 ID를 사용하고 있습니다. 대신 추론 "
"프로필 ID를 사용하세요(예: `anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6` 대신 "
"`us.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6`)."

#: ../../source/agents/docs/aws_bedrock_setup.md
msgid "`ThrottlingException: Too many tokens per day`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/aws_bedrock_setup.md
msgid ""
"Your account may have a zero on-demand quota for this model. Check "
"[Service "
"Quotas](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/bedrock/latest/userguide/quotas.html)"
" in the AWS console for your target region. New accounts may need to open"
" an AWS Support ticket or try a different region."
msgstr ""
"이 모델에 대한 계정의 온디맨드 할당량이 0일 수 있습니다. AWS 콘솔에서 대상 리전의 "
"[Service "
"Quotas](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/bedrock/latest/userguide/quotas.html)"
"를 확인하세요. 신규 계정은 AWS Support 티켓을 열거나 다른 리전을 시도해야 할 수 "
"있습니다."

#: ../../source/agents/docs/aws_bedrock_setup.md
msgid "`failed to load AWS config`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/docs/aws_bedrock_setup.md
msgid ""
"Verify the IAM instance profile is attached to the EC2 instance. Check "
"with `curl http://169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data/iam/security-"
"credentials/`."
msgstr ""
"IAM 인스턴스 프로필이 EC2 인스턴스에 연결되어 있는지 확인하세요. `curl "
"http://169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data/iam/security-credentials/`로 "
"확인합니다."

#: ../../source/agents/docs/aws_bedrock_setup.md
msgid "Agent responds with \"An error occurred while accessing the LLM\""
msgstr "에이전트가 \"An error occurred while accessing the LLM\"으로 응답함"

#: ../../source/agents/docs/aws_bedrock_setup.md
msgid ""
"Check the server logs for the specific error. Common causes: incorrect "
"model ID, model not available in the selected region, or insufficient IAM"
" permissions."
msgstr ""
"특정 오류에 대해 서버 로그를 확인하세요. 일반적인 원인: 잘못된 모델 ID, 선택한 "
"리전에서 사용할 수 없는 모델, 또는 불충분한 IAM 권한."

#: ../../source/agents/docs/aws_bedrock_setup.md
msgid "Plugin won't enable"
msgstr "플러그인이 활성화되지 않음"

#: ../../source/agents/docs/aws_bedrock_setup.md
msgid ""
"Ensure you have a valid Mattermost Enterprise license and the plugin "
"version is compatible with your server version."
msgstr ""
"유효한 Mattermost Enterprise 라이선스가 있고 플러그인 버전이 서버 버전과 호환되는지 "
"확인하세요."

#: ../../source/agents/docs/aws_bedrock_setup.md:247
msgid "Authentication options"
msgstr "인증 옵션"

#: ../../source/agents/docs/aws_bedrock_setup.md:249
msgid ""
"While IAM instance profiles are recommended for EC2 deployments, the "
"Agents plugin supports three authentication methods for Bedrock:"
msgstr ""
"EC2 배포에는 IAM 인스턴스 프로필이 권장되지만, 에이전트 플러그인은 Bedrock에 대해 "
"세 가지 인증 방식을 지원합니다:"

#: ../../source/agents/docs/aws_bedrock_setup.md:251
msgid ""
"**IAM instance profile** (recommended for EC2): No credentials needed. "
"The AWS SDK uses the EC2 metadata service automatically."
msgstr ""
"**IAM 인스턴스 프로필**(EC2 권장): 자격 증명이 필요 없습니다. AWS SDK가 EC2 "
"메타데이터 서비스를 자동으로 사용합니다."

#: ../../source/agents/docs/aws_bedrock_setup.md:252
msgid ""
"**IAM user credentials**: Enter the `AWS Access Key ID` and `AWS Secret "
"Access Key` in the service configuration. Useful for non-EC2 deployments."
msgstr ""
"**IAM 사용자 자격 증명**: 서비스 구성에 `AWS Access Key ID`와 `AWS Secret Access "
"Key`를 입력합니다. 비 EC2 배포에 유용합니다."

#: ../../source/agents/docs/aws_bedrock_setup.md:253
msgid ""
"**Bedrock API key**: Enter a Bedrock console-generated API key in the "
"`API Key` field. Suitable for short-term testing (keys expire after 12 "
"hours)."
msgstr ""
"**Bedrock API 키**: `API Key` 필드에 Bedrock 콘솔에서 생성한 API 키를 입력합니다. "
"단기 테스트에 적합합니다(키는 12시간 후 만료됨)."

#: ../../source/agents/docs/aws_bedrock_setup.md:255
msgid ""
"Credentials are evaluated in the order listed above. If IAM credential "
"fields are populated, they take precedence over the API key and the "
"default credential chain."
msgstr ""
"자격 증명은 위에 나열된 순서로 평가됩니다. IAM 자격 증명 필드가 채워져 있으면, API "
"키 및 기본 자격 증명 체인보다 우선합니다."

